WEBVTT

00:08:56.537 --> 00:09:01.162
Our challenge is to come together
to preserve our collective self-interest

00:09:01.162 --> 00:09:02.662
and humanity

00:09:02.704 --> 00:09:05.287
rather than tearing ourselves asunder.

00:09:06.246 --> 00:09:09.496
People and planet in balance,

00:09:09.496 --> 00:09:12.454
building lasting sustainable peace.

00:09:13.287 --> 00:09:14.537
Thank you.